  "description": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Abertay University is a public university in Dundee, Scotland. Originally founded in 1888 as Dundee Technical Institute, it gained university status in 1994. Abertay is world-renowned for Computer Games Technology — it was the first university to offer a degree in this subject (1997) and is consistently ranked #1 in the UK by The Princeton Review and GamesAware. The Abertay Cybersecurity programmes are also leading, and the BSc Ethical Hacking is the first of its kind. Abertay's campus is in the centre of Dundee.",
      "International students enter via Oxford International pathway programmes — International Foundation, International Year One, and Pre-Master courses lead into Abertay Bachelor's and Master's degrees."
    ],
    "paragraphsRu": [
      "Abertay University — государственный университет в Данди, Шотландия. Основан в 1888 как Dundee Technical Institute, статус университета — с 1994. Всемирно известен Computer Games Technology — первый в мире BSc-курс (1997) и #1 в UK по версии Princeton Review и GamesAware. Программы Cybersecurity также ведущие, BSc Ethical Hacking — первая в мире. Кампус в центре Данди.",
      "Международные студенты заходят через pathway-программы Oxford International — International Foundation, International Year One и Pre-Master ведут в бакалавриат / магистратуру Abertay."
